{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OnboardingKit has various "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Onboarding","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" types that can be used to tailor an onboarding experience behavior, as well as various views."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Onboarding","type":"heading","anchor":"Onboarding"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Onboarding","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" determines the behavior of an onboarding experience."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use an onboarding, just create a type based on the behavior you want, and call "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Onboarding\/tryPresent(after:action:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to present it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Onboarding.regular(id: \"welcome\").tryPresent { ","    \/\/ Show a sheet, modal, popover, or anything you want","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The onboarding will only call the presentation when it makes sense to present the onboarding, based on which kind of onboarding it is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Onboarding Types","type":"heading","anchor":"Onboarding-Types"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are different onboarding types for different behaviors."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Onboarding\/regular(id:store:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is presented right away, and only once."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Onboarding\/conditional(id:store:condition:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is presented when a condition returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Onboarding\/correctBehavior(id:store:requiredIncorrectAttempts:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is used to establish a desired behavior."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Onboarding\/delayed(id:store:requiredPresentationAttempts:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is presented after a certain number of attempts."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Onboarding\/whatsNew(info:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is only presented if the provided "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/OnboardingWhatsNewInfo","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" has new items to present."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can also create a custom onboarding type by inheriting and customizing any of these classes and overriding its various functions."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Flows","type":"heading","anchor":"Flows"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OnboardingKit has flows for presenting multiple pages. An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/OnboardingPageView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be used to let users swipe through horizontal pages, while an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/OnboardingSlideshow","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" automatically progresses through a collection of pages."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Flows-Article","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" article for more information."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Intro","type":"heading","anchor":"Intro"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OnboardingKit has intro views that can welcome users to your app. An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/OnboardingIntroScreen","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" shows a title, an optional text, and a list of the most important features of your app. It can be used as a stand-alone screen, or as a page in a flow."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/Intro-Article","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" article for more information."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"USPs","type":"heading","anchor":"USPs"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OnboardingKit has an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/OnboardingUsp","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" type that describes a “unique selling point”, with an icon, an optional title, and a text. USPs can be listed with an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/OnboardingUspList","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which animates them in one after another. This list is also used in other views."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.OnboardingKit\/documentation\/OnboardingKit\/USPs-Article","isActive":true},{"type":"text","t